          "main": {
            "content": "== {{int:filedesc}} ==\n{{Information\n|Description={{en|{{c|Girolamo Cavazzoni}}'s ''Ave Maris Stella'', played on MyOrgan.\n\n\nSee also \"[[:en:Girolamo Cavazzoni #List of works|''Intavolatura cioe recercari, canzoni, himni, magnificat [...] libro primo'' (Venice, 1543)]]\".}} \n\n\n\n{{fr|''Ave Maris Stella'', de {{c|Girolamo Cavazzoni}}, utilisant MyOrgan.\n\n\nVoir aussi \"[[:fr:Girolamo Cavazzoni #Détail|''Intavolatura cioè Recercari, Canzoni, Himni, Magnificat composti per Hieronimo de Marcantonio da Bologna, detto d'Urbino, Libro Primo'' (Venise, 1543)]]\".}}\n\n\n\n\n{{it|''Ave Maris Stella'', de {{c|Girolamo Cavazzoni}}, suonato a MyOrgan.\n\n\nVedi anche \"[[:it:Girolamo Cavazzoni #Opere|Intavolatura cioe recercari, canzoni, himni, magnificat [...] libro primo (Venezia, 1543): Quattro inni]]\".}}\n|Source={{Own}}\n|Date=2008-07-30\n|Author= [[User:BastienM|BastienM]]\n|Permission=original work in public domain\n|other_versions=\n}}\n== {{int:license-header}} ==\n{{self|GFDL|cc-by-sa-3.0,2.5,2.0,1.0}}\n\n[[Category:Audio files of renaissance period classical music]]\n[[Category:Audio files of organ music]]\n[[Category:Ave maris stella]]\n[[Category:Girolamo Cavazzoni]]\n[[Category:1540s music in Italy]]\n[[Category:1543 works]]\n[[Category:C major]]\n[[Category:Half cadences]]",
